W:
W:Rig-a-Jig Jig is a nursery rhyme, as well as a dance tune.
W:
W:I've seen lyrics that go like this:
W: 
W:(Ch) Rig-a-jig-jig, and away we go, away we go, away we go,
W:Rig-a-jig-jig, and away we go, away, away, away. (2x)
W:
W:As I was walking down the street, away we go, away we go, away we go,
W:A pretty girl I chanced to meet, away, away, away,
W:I said young maid what is your trade, away we go, away we go, away we go,
W:She said I am a weaver's maid, away, away, away.
W:
W:I suggest you make up more verses as you wish!
